1
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:18,270
♪I stretch and yawn
when the sun is high in the sky♪

2
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:23,030
♪A cup of tea and a little tune,
what a carefree life♪

3
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:28,480
♪The fortune teller said
love would come my way this year♪

4
00:00:28,740 --> 00:00:32,580
♪But all I see is my food
arriving right on time♪

5
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,670
♪No rush, no worries♪

6
00:00:35,670 --> 00:00:38,360
♪Love is all a matter of chance♪

7
00:00:38,640 --> 00:00:40,480
♪Flowers bloom and fade♪

8
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:43,380
♪I'd rather take good care
of myself first♪

9
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,580
♪Two orioles sing among
the green willows♪

10
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,970
♪And I still don't have a boyfriend♪

11
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:50,590
♪My best years are nothing
to worry about♪

12
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,240
♪I'll stay happily single
till I'm old and gray♪

13
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:07,540
=Besties' Coming Fortune=

14
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:09,980
=Episode 16=

15
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,590
You know so much about my affairs,

16
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:31,200
yet you dare come here
to meet your death?

17
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:33,540
I've come to see Your Highness

18
00:01:34,430 --> 00:01:36,360
to propose a deal.

19
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,560
The person Your Highness is looking for

20
00:01:38,870 --> 00:01:40,430
is also being sought
by Marquis Jingyuan's family.

21
00:01:41,350 --> 00:01:43,590
Only I know where she is now.

22
00:01:43,790 --> 00:01:45,030
If Your Highness agrees,

23
00:01:46,430 --> 00:01:48,150
I can make her come to you willingly.

24
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,150
Go on.

25
00:01:56,950 --> 00:01:57,720
What do you want?

26
00:01:58,150 --> 00:02:00,200
The Marquis's Manor
has utterly humiliated me.

27
00:02:01,310 --> 00:02:02,360
I have a plan

28
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:05,200
that will let me avenge that humiliation

29
00:02:06,430 --> 00:02:08,000
and help Your Highness

30
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:10,790
eliminate the threat once and for all.

31
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:11,990
Shen Cheng.

32
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,160
Shen He.

33
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,600
Marquis Jingyuan refused
to cooperate back then.

34
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:21,680
And now you two brothers

35
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:23,480
intend to follow in his footsteps.

36
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:25,830
Then don't blame me

37
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:28,390
for wiping out your entire family.

38
00:02:36,910 --> 00:02:37,440
Dear,

39
00:02:38,870 --> 00:02:40,080
don't you think

40
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,200
there's something strange about
Song Zhang, the original heroine?

41
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,040
You think so too?

42
00:02:47,150 --> 00:02:47,910
I mean, she already

43
00:02:47,910 --> 00:02:49,230
tried to drug us both.

44
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,360
And last night, she even used

45
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,640
aphrodisiac incense on Shen Cheng.

46
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,040
That's pretty wild.

47
00:02:57,400 --> 00:02:59,880
Is that even a proper novel
you're reading?

48
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:02,310
Anyway, in the original novel,

49
00:03:02,310 --> 00:03:03,270
she was nothing like this.

50
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:05,390
It's almost as if
she's become a different person.

51
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:08,790
Could she have entered the novel too?

52
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,200
- No way.
- No way.

53
00:03:45,150 --> 00:03:45,830
Wake up!

54
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:47,270
Quick!

55
00:03:47,870 --> 00:03:49,710
How did we end up on the pleasure boat?

56
00:04:01,190 --> 00:04:02,760
Why are we wearing
wedding clothes again?

57
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,950
Could it be

58
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:06,830
that the novel's system has restarted?

59
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:11,440
All the windows
have been sealed shut too.

60
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,520
Looks like someone deliberately

61
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,600
brought us here.

62
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:15,920
Not bad.

63
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,830
You're not quite as stupid as I thought.

64
00:04:23,950 --> 00:04:25,080
Song Zhang?

65
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,350
You brought us here?

66
00:04:28,270 --> 00:04:29,470
Why would you do this?

67
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:31,120
Because you two

68
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,030
were supposed to die here!

69
00:04:38,830 --> 00:04:39,910
What do you mean?

70
00:04:40,270 --> 00:04:41,640
We've done nothing to you.

71
00:04:42,430 --> 00:04:43,950
Why would you be so cruel?

72
00:04:44,190 --> 00:04:45,440
As long as you two are alive,

73
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,150
you're standing in my way.

74
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:48,270
If it weren't for you,

75
00:04:48,390 --> 00:04:50,830
why would Shen Cheng avoid me
like the plague

76
00:04:50,830 --> 00:04:52,880
and Shen He treat me so coldly?

77
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:54,510
The position
of the Wife of the Marquis's Heir,

78
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:56,120
the glory of the Marquis's Manor,

79
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:57,880
and the affection
of Shen Cheng and Shen He,

80
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,270
all of it should have been mine!

81
00:05:04,190 --> 00:05:06,710
When Xiang framed you for adultery
on the pleasure boat,

82
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:08,510
you should have

83
00:05:08,510 --> 00:05:10,240
been stabbed to death
by those two brothers.

84
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:18,390
Your Lordship.

85
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:19,120
Third Young Master.

86
00:05:19,390 --> 00:05:20,710
We've searched the entire manor
and its surroundings.

87
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,560
We haven't found any trace

88
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,710
of Third Madam or Her Ladyship.

89
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,350
Keep looking.

90
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,040
Two living people

91
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,320
can't just vanish into thin air.

92
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,270
Your Lordship.

93
00:05:29,510 --> 00:05:30,920
While patrolling the rear storeroom,

94
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:31,950
I noticed clear signs

95
00:05:31,950 --> 00:05:32,830
that the lock had been forced open.

96
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:33,830
What's missing?

97
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:34,710
Strangely enough,

98
00:05:35,070 --> 00:05:36,160
none of the gold, silver, jewels,

99
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,390
or other valuables are missing.

100
00:05:37,870 --> 00:05:39,000
The only things taken were

101
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:40,240
Her Ladyship's and Third Madam's
wedding dresses.

102
00:05:42,430 --> 00:05:44,030
Who would steal wedding dresses?

103
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,750
Investigate Song Zhang's

104
00:05:46,750 --> 00:05:47,640
movements tonight immediately.

105
00:05:47,830 --> 00:05:48,240
Prepare a horse.

106
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:48,590
Yes.

107
00:05:49,750 --> 00:05:50,510
My wife is missing too.

108
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,200
Prepare two.

109
00:05:54,310 --> 00:05:55,800
How do you know all this?

110
00:05:56,190 --> 00:05:57,320
What good does knowing do?

111
00:05:58,270 --> 00:06:00,120
I went to great lengths
to steal that jade pendant,

112
00:06:00,430 --> 00:06:02,190
thinking I could stay
at the Marquis's Manor

113
00:06:02,190 --> 00:06:03,640
and enjoy all its privileges.

114
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,880
But then you two came along.

115
00:06:06,830 --> 00:06:07,950
You stole the jade pendant?

116
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,760
So it wasn't yours?

117
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,510
Then where's its rightful owner?

118
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,390
She?

119
00:06:15,310 --> 00:06:17,510
She's just a worthless nobody.

120
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:20,470
But you two...

121
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:22,030
In the previous life,

122
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,120
you were supposed to

123
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,430
fall victim to the First Madam's schemes

124
00:06:24,430 --> 00:06:25,800
and die here on this pleasure boat,

125
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,830
without even your remains being found.

126
00:06:26,950 --> 00:06:27,560
Your Lordship.

127
00:06:27,950 --> 00:06:29,200
I've finally found you.

128
00:06:31,950 --> 00:06:33,320
I only want to uncover the truth.

129
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,640
Why won't any of you believe me?

130
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,350
I believe you.

131
00:06:43,430 --> 00:06:44,590
The previous life?

132
00:06:45,750 --> 00:06:47,510
Weren't we transported into
a novel about household scheming?

133
00:06:48,310 --> 00:06:49,950
Since when did it involve rebirth too?

134
00:06:50,950 --> 00:06:52,000
Why must you

135
00:06:52,190 --> 00:06:53,440
stand in my way in this life as well?

136
00:06:58,390 --> 00:06:59,470
Song Zhang, have you lost your mind?

137
00:06:59,830 --> 00:07:00,830
What are you doing?

138
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:03,710
Since fate has gone off course,

139
00:07:04,270 --> 00:07:05,390
I'll personally

140
00:07:06,390 --> 00:07:07,910
set everything back
on its original path.

141
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:11,240
If I can't have it,

142
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,270
neither can you.

143
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:22,720
Hurry!

144
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:23,150
Let's go!

145
00:07:31,510 --> 00:07:32,320
There's too much smoke.

146
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:33,640
Cover your nose and mouth.

147
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:40,030
- Go!
- Go!

148
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:49,350
Shutiao.

149
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:50,800
Don't be afraid.

150
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:51,270
Don't be afraid.

151
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:53,390
I'll get you out of here.

152
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:54,560
Don't be afraid.

153
00:07:54,950 --> 00:07:55,760
Can you stand?

154
00:07:56,430 --> 00:07:56,710
Come on.

155
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,470
I'll carry you.

156
00:07:58,390 --> 00:07:58,590
Here.

157
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:09,920
Your Highness.

158
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:10,470
Everything is done.

159
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,200
Congratulations, Your Highness,

160
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:16,560
on eliminating your enemies.

161
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:17,820
I've already sent word

162
00:08:17,820 --> 00:08:19,240
to the person you're looking for.

163
00:08:19,870 --> 00:08:21,510
She'll arrive in the capital
in a few days.

164
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,280
Did you foresee

165
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,440
your own death today?

166
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,630
You know too much about me.

167
00:08:41,630 --> 00:08:42,590
I can't let you live.

168
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:46,830
Get rid of her.

169
00:08:57,630 --> 00:08:58,710
Predicting the future?

170
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,080
I've never been one

171
00:09:04,150 --> 00:09:05,560
to believe in fate.

172
00:09:07,550 --> 00:09:08,590
Prepare some silver.

173
00:09:09,510 --> 00:09:11,470
We'll pay our respects
at Marquis Jingyuan's Manor tomorrow.

174
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:20,870
Shutiao.

175
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,710
Shutiao, stay awake.

176
00:09:24,030 --> 00:09:24,540
Shutiao.

177
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,200
Cheng.

178
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:33,040
Are we...

179
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:34,270
Are we

180
00:09:34,270 --> 00:09:35,920
both going to die here for love?

181
00:09:37,240 --> 00:09:37,990
Keep talking nonsense,

182
00:09:38,910 --> 00:09:40,350
and I'll throw you into the fire myself.

183
00:09:42,510 --> 00:09:42,990
Shutiao.

184
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:44,560
Shutiao.

185
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:46,470
Wake up.

186
00:09:47,390 --> 00:09:47,870
Shutiao.

187
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:51,590
Do you remember

188
00:09:52,670 --> 00:09:53,550
how they managed

189
00:09:53,550 --> 00:09:54,990
to escape Xiang's pleasure boat
last time?

190
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:57,830
Smoke...

191
00:09:58,510 --> 00:09:59,230
The fireworks tube!

192
00:10:22,810 --> 00:10:25,130
♪No matter how
the universe changes tomorrow♪

193
00:10:25,130 --> 00:10:32,330
♪Right now,
I just want to stay by your side♪

194
00:10:32,330 --> 00:10:37,530
♪Let this kiss and this dream
last until we're old♪

195
00:10:38,730 --> 00:10:43,770
♪And hold on to all
the tenderness of this moment♪

196
00:10:45,130 --> 00:10:50,210
♪Following this heartbeat,
we'll retrace our steps♪

197
00:10:51,570 --> 00:10:56,690
♪As time goes by,
all I need is your gaze♪

198
00:10:57,970 --> 00:11:01,330
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪

199
00:11:20,090 --> 00:11:23,450
♪One dream until our hair turns gray♪
